  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "たいもうから　はなつ　いかずちであたりを　やきつくすと　いわれる。くわしいことは　わかっていない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "털에서 내뿜는 벼락으로 주변을 모조리 태워 버린다고 전해진다. 자세한 정보는 밝혀진 것이 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "據說會從體毛釋放出雷電將周圍燒成焦土。具體詳情不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On raconte que la foudre qui s’échappe de sa fourrure peut brûler tout ce qui l’entoure, mais on en sait peu sur lui.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Man sagt, dass es mit den Blitzen, die es aus seinem Fell abfeuert, alles in seiner Umgebung zu Asche verbrennt. Genaueres ist nicht bekannt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que calcina todo cuanto lo rodea con los rayos que libera su pelaje. Aparte de eso, se sabe muy poco sobre esta criatura.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si dice che incenerisca i dintorni con i fulmini che erompono dalla sua pelliccia. Questo è tutto ciò che si sa su questo Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It’s said to incinerate everything around it with lightning launched from its fur. Very little is known about this creature.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "体毛から　放つ　雷であたりを　焼きつくすと　いわれる。詳しいことは　わかっていない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "据说会从体毛释放出雷电将周围烧毁。具体详情不明。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se dice que calcina todo cuanto lo rodea con los rayos que libera su pelaje. Aparte de eso, se sabe muy poco sobre esta criatura.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルトざっしが　とりあげてみじかい　あいだ　わだいになったライコウの　そせんに　にている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "오컬트 잡지에 나와 한동안 화제였던 라이코의 선조를 닮았다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "與超自然雜誌曾報導且掀起了短暫話題的雷公的祖先長得很像。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il rappelle un ancêtre de Raikou qui a brièvement fait parler de lui quand il a été mentionné dans une revue sur les phénomènes paranormaux.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es ähnelt einem Vorfahren von Raikou, der kurz Gesprächsthema Nummer eins war, nachdem eine esoterische Zeitschrift über ihn berichtet hatte.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Recuerda a un presunto antepasado de Raikou que dio bastante que hablar durante un tiempo tras aparecer en una revista esotérica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ricorda un antenato di Raikou che per qualche tempo fece scalpore dopo essere apparso in una rivista di paranormale.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It bears resemblance to a Pokémon that became a hot topic for a short while after a paranormal magazine touted it as Raikou’s ancestor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "オカルト雑誌が　取り上げて短い　あいだ　話題になったライコウの　祖先に　似ている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "与超自然杂志报道的曾短暂引起一阵话题的雷公的祖先长得很像。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
